        <item>
            <title>2.06</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 08:17:00 +0700</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[<html><head><meta charset='utf-8'><style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}body{font:13px/1.45 -apple-system,system-ui,sans-serif;margin:0;padding:0 4px}h2{font-size:20px;margin:6px 0 4px}h3{font-size:13px;margin:16px 0 4px}p{margin:4px 0}.date{opacity:.6}ul{margin:4px 0;padding-left:20px}li{margin:4px 0}code{font:12px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace}</style></head><body><h2>2.06</h2><p class="date">Release date: 8 Oct 2026</p><h3>New in 2.06</h3><ul><li>Skills ends on the same Total tokens row as every other tab. Click it to switch to No-skill tokens, in any sort.</li><li>The menu bar bolt turns orange only while a chat's context keeps growing. Green cards, like an expired cache, no longer color it.</li></ul></body></html>]]></description>
